      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/translation-refresh.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "§4 Translate only the new and fuzzy strings",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-11-14: an unrestricted, open machine-translation step for the gettext catalogues, so no freemium API quota is involved — OPUS-MT run locally or a self-hosted LibreTranslate (Tool translation-candidates). The same day: several sources per string as CANDIDATES a reviewer chooses among, never a barrier to having a translation, so an empty msgstr gets the first good candidate as fuzzy. The DeepL / Google Translate route is no longer recommended; paid services are mentioned, not added.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-11-14"
      ]
